      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Persistent postoperative incisional pain after aortocoronary bypass surgery was reported by a patient in whom allergies to metals contained in the stainless steel suture used for sternal closure were confirmed by patch testing. The symptoms resolved promptly after the sutures were removed."},
